Motorola Moto G7 Play (channel) firmware for mainline Linux.

Provenance: stock dump PPYS29.105-57-4 (100Daisy/motorola_channel_dump).
Hashes: see SHA256SUMS.

Layout:
  wlan/         WCNSS_qcom_wlan_nv*.bin (base + Argentina/Brazil/India/epa).
                Install base as qcom/msm8953/motorola/channel/WCNSS_qcom_wlan_nv.bin.
  qcom/         Adreno 506 a530_pm4.fw + a530_pfp.fw (stock versions).
  touchscreen/  Ilitek ILI9881 (DSBJ) + Novatek NT36525/NT36525B (DJN)
                firmware, kept for the future touch driver ports.
                No mainline driver consumes them yet.

Pending (later milestones, need extraction + hardware validation):
  a506_zap.mdt/.b0* (GPU secure shader), mba.mbn/modem.mbn (modem),
  adsp.mbn (audio DSP), venus.mbn (video), WCNSS.mbn.
